WEBVTT

00:00.900 --> 00:02.480
Previously on Working...

00:03.520 --> 00:04.810
Then this is...

00:05.110 --> 00:07.070
Yeah. Our mom.

00:07.390 --> 00:10.220
Ahem. Thank you for everything.

00:10.220 --> 00:12.650
Yamada is going home.

00:18.850 --> 00:20.330
I'm back.

00:20.330 --> 00:23.330
W-Welcome home, Mom.

00:23.690 --> 00:27.880
And I'm thinking of making you
the next chief after Yachiyo leaves.

00:29.110 --> 00:30.760
M-Me!?

00:31.070 --> 00:34.220
<i>After interacting with the real Inami-san while cross-dressing</i>

00:34.630 --> 00:37.130
<i>I feel like I've sorted out most of my feelings.</i>

00:38.610 --> 00:40.240
I love you.

00:40.900 --> 00:43.440
I want you to see
more of the outside world...

00:44.310 --> 00:48.230
and I want you to be with me.

00:49.940 --> 00:52.650
Y-You were going there anyway, right?

00:52.650 --> 00:54.150
You didn't mean this as a date, right?

00:54.550 --> 00:55.660
No. This is a date.

00:55.660 --> 00:58.410
Something came up,
I had to leave
without you.
Takanashi Souta

01:00.890 --> 01:02.400
Takanashi-kun?

01:17.310 --> 01:21.520
This is boring—I want you to read me

01:21.520 --> 01:25.400
I want to make these feelings clear

01:25.400 --> 01:29.400
I can't hold back—I want to take the leap

01:29.400 --> 01:33.280
I want a message from the heavens

01:33.280 --> 01:37.290
If you don't shuffle things up, you'll never change,

01:37.290 --> 01:41.330
and remain trapped in your illusion

01:41.330 --> 01:45.250
I want to call it, but with this pressure,

01:45.250 --> 01:49.500
I can't say the magic word

01:50.730 --> 01:53.720
Let's take a gamble today

01:53.720 --> 01:56.640
It's an all or nothing bet on the unknown

01:56.640 --> 01:59.260
Let's do it

01:59.260 --> 02:01.420
It's time to go wild,

02:01.420 --> 02:07.270
and explore the mysteries of love

02:07.270 --> 02:12.030
It's time to fan the flames when things get messy

02:12.030 --> 02:16.570
Come join us!

02:37.590 --> 02:39.300
Wipe the table in a circular motion.

02:38.220 --> 02:42.970
Ep 14

02:38.220 --> 02:42.970
Lord of the Takanashi

02:39.810 --> 02:41.970
This is Yamada's style.

02:43.560 --> 02:45.320
Nazuna-chan's here.

02:45.320 --> 02:46.320
Yeah.

02:46.320 --> 02:49.350
Katanashi-kun is off,
so she's taking his shift.

02:50.310 --> 02:52.860
Takanashi-kun's been gone for a while, hasn't he?

02:53.750 --> 02:57.030
Now that you mention it, I haven't seen him since we took that group photo.

02:57.850 --> 02:59.350
Huh.

02:59.350 --> 03:00.750
Did something happen?

03:00.750 --> 03:03.870
N-No. Nothing...

03:03.870 --> 03:05.830
At least, I don't think so.

03:06.310 --> 03:09.410
He's been gone ever since then...

03:09.410 --> 03:10.790
I wonder if something did happen.

03:15.860 --> 03:17.340
You want to use Yamada as an example?

03:17.340 --> 03:21.090
Yes. Please let me use you as a role model, Senpai.

03:21.870 --> 03:21.930
THROB

03:21.910 --> 03:23.050
Senpai!

03:23.520 --> 03:27.260
So you see, you have to be thorough when wiping. No cutting corners!

03:27.260 --> 03:29.100
I'm learning already!

03:29.550 --> 03:32.020
<i>So that's how she gets her to work!</i>

03:33.790 --> 03:37.550
You're carrying that? I'll help.

03:37.550 --> 03:38.730
No, it's okay.

03:40.060 --> 03:42.580
Actually, I just remembered something else that I need to do.

03:42.580 --> 03:44.580
Could I get you to take them after all?

03:44.580 --> 03:45.640
Of course.

03:45.640 --> 03:47.120
Thank you.

03:47.580 --> 03:48.440
Yachiyo.

03:49.380 --> 03:50.810
Satou-kun...

03:50.810 --> 03:53.140
You're carrying those? I'll help.

03:53.140 --> 03:54.460
Thank you.

03:55.450 --> 03:57.740
<i>So that's how she gets them together?</i>

03:59.090 --> 04:00.130
Order Five's ready.

04:00.790 --> 04:01.590
Thanks.

04:04.260 --> 04:09.640
<i>Nazuna-chan seems to have matured a lot since the last time I saw her.</i>

04:09.640 --> 04:12.680
That's what I heard, so please look into it for me.

04:12.680 --> 04:13.440
Sure thing.

04:14.400 --> 04:17.480
Nazuna-chan, don't let him corrupt you!

04:18.350 --> 04:20.190
What do you think I am?

04:20.190 --> 04:24.680
No, um, I wanted Souma-san
to look into something,

04:24.680 --> 04:27.880
because my brother said
he's good at things like that.

04:27.880 --> 04:28.660
Oh.

04:29.170 --> 04:33.160
Yeah... but I'm impressed that you knew that at all.

04:33.620 --> 04:35.450
You've got a bright future ahead of you.

04:35.450 --> 04:37.940
<i>Even Souma-san recognizes her talents!</i>

04:39.420 --> 04:40.510
Your mother?

04:40.510 --> 04:41.780
Yes.

04:41.780 --> 04:44.220
She's been home for a while now.

04:44.220 --> 04:48.350
But my brother and sisters are having a tough time dealing with her.

04:48.870 --> 04:52.100
<i>Is that why Katanashi-kun hasn't come to work?</i>

04:52.690 --> 04:58.640
I don't want to see my beloved brother and sisters suffer.

04:58.640 --> 05:01.030
That's why I'm going to surpass my mother!

05:01.360 --> 05:04.110
I'll protect everyone!

05:04.550 --> 05:08.090
<i>Maybe it's just me, but it feels like Nazuna-chan just got bigger!</i>

05:09.350 --> 05:10.280
<i>But she's right.</i>

05:10.280 --> 05:13.960
<i>I'm going to be the Chief soon, it's time I started acting like it!</i>

05:14.270 --> 05:16.990
I see you're in high spirits today as well, Taneshima.

05:16.990 --> 05:19.020
It's just daily diligence.

05:19.020 --> 05:21.170
I don't know what I can do,

05:21.740 --> 05:24.860
but I'm going to keep growing
in my own way, and one day...

05:24.860 --> 05:27.130
I'll be just like Nazuna-chan!

05:27.710 --> 05:30.600
Your goal is to become
an elementary school student?

05:33.600 --> 05:36.100
The Next Day

05:36.540 --> 05:40.760
This is the 14th time this month that you've disappeared, Haruna-san.

05:40.760 --> 05:43.570
She always vanishes the moment I take my eyes off of her.

05:43.920 --> 05:45.700
I'm sorry.

05:46.020 --> 05:48.260
Maybe I'm not watching her closely enough?

05:48.260 --> 05:50.820
And here I thought watching people was my one strength.

05:51.330 --> 05:53.330
It's okay, Souma-kun.

05:53.330 --> 05:55.120
Souma-san, it's Yamada!

05:55.120 --> 05:57.350
Yamada's here!

05:57.350 --> 06:00.200
Because you see, she'll disappear even if you don't look away.

06:00.200 --> 06:01.110
How!?

06:02.340 --> 06:06.550
So anyway, can you find Haruna-san for me?

06:06.930 --> 06:09.000
That happens to be Yamada's specialty.

06:09.000 --> 06:10.640
The only one, I would say.

06:10.640 --> 06:13.160
I-I have other skills, too!

06:13.160 --> 06:14.880
Maybe two more!

06:18.230 --> 06:20.440
This is a father-daughter stroll, right?

06:20.440 --> 06:21.950
<i>That really rubs me the wrong way...</i>

06:21.950 --> 06:23.070
Wait, that's wrong.

06:23.700 --> 06:26.020
Yamada already has a mother.

06:26.020 --> 06:27.950
So this is a father-former-daughter stroll.

06:27.950 --> 06:30.660
<i>Why did this suddenly get so complex?</i>

06:31.430 --> 06:33.620
Now I've lost Yamada-san!

06:39.000 --> 06:39.930
U-Um...

06:41.900 --> 06:45.300
<i>H-He looks mad, maybe I should just keep quiet.</i>

06:48.220 --> 06:51.720
Th-That was Takanashi-kun, wasn't it?

06:59.680 --> 07:00.810
Otoo-san!

07:01.290 --> 07:03.840
Yamada-san... and Haruna-san!

07:03.840 --> 07:05.070
Thank goodness!

07:05.490 --> 07:06.800
Everything's fine.

07:06.800 --> 07:08.530
Now try not to get lost again.

07:09.090 --> 07:10.990
I'm<i> the one who got lost?</i>

07:11.850 --> 07:14.390
We've been married
for quite some time now,

07:14.390 --> 07:17.450
but I still can't find my wife by myself.

07:17.840 --> 07:19.980
Cheer up, dear.

07:19.980 --> 07:22.420
It's my fault for constantly getting lost.

07:22.740 --> 07:24.900
Let's be positive about it.

07:24.900 --> 07:28.900
Like being apart only strengthens our yearning...

07:28.900 --> 07:30.800
That only gets you so far!

07:31.400 --> 07:34.340
Anyway, why don't we
go back to the restaurant?

07:34.340 --> 07:38.100
Ah, that's right. Yamada-san, I saw Takanashi-kun...

07:40.000 --> 07:42.270
Lost them again...

07:48.860 --> 07:52.660
<i>I can't believe I ran into Otoo-san, whom I rarely see to begin with.</i>

07:52.660 --> 07:55.120
<i>Though I don't think he recognized me.</i>

07:58.090 --> 08:01.960
Oh, I just came here to pick up
my uniform so I could wash it...

08:01.960 --> 08:05.920
and I can't have Nazuna go into
the men's changing room to get it...

08:07.540 --> 08:08.620
Excuse me!

08:14.890 --> 08:18.350
We're having this meeting
because I'm worried about Takanashi.

08:18.350 --> 08:21.600
You never cared before...

08:21.600 --> 08:24.100
Why the change of heart, Kyouko-san?

08:27.770 --> 08:29.690
It's obvious he needs help.

08:30.410 --> 08:33.430
Do any of you have any idea what's bothering him?

08:34.560 --> 08:37.450
It seems like he's been dealing with a lot of stuff...

08:37.450 --> 08:39.590
Senpai!

08:40.370 --> 08:42.370
But he always looks so happy.

08:42.370 --> 08:46.650
This place is the only
comfort Takanashi-kun has.

08:46.650 --> 08:50.880
If we're talking about reasons why he might not be coming to work, Yamada...

08:50.880 --> 08:51.650
Yamada!

08:51.650 --> 08:53.630
Yamada, how many times have I told you?

08:53.630 --> 08:55.800
Sheesh! Yamada, you're impossible to work with!

08:56.160 --> 08:57.460
...has no clue.

08:57.460 --> 08:58.510
Are you sure?

08:58.510 --> 09:00.720
I don't have any idea either.

09:00.720 --> 09:05.480
Maybe he got fed up with Satou-kun and Todoroki-san's constant flirting.

09:07.000 --> 09:10.150
Yachiyo, ignore 99%
of anything Souma says.

09:10.480 --> 09:11.360
U-Um...

09:11.920 --> 09:14.300
I-It may be me.

09:14.300 --> 09:16.070
R-Recently...

09:16.470 --> 09:18.820
how can I say this... I may have...

09:21.580 --> 09:25.190
overtaxed him physically and mentally in various ways...

09:25.190 --> 09:27.570
You look overtaxed as well.

09:28.430 --> 09:30.840
I wonder if something happened to Katanashi-kun.

09:31.240 --> 09:32.590
What should we do, Kyouko-san?

09:33.800 --> 09:37.520
After listening to all of you,
I've tried considering various possibilities...

09:39.020 --> 09:40.540
but thinking is a pain in the ass.

09:41.530 --> 09:44.550
So I'll just try calling and asking directly.

09:44.550 --> 09:46.550
Why'd you even bother with a meeting?

09:47.370 --> 09:52.040
So why are you still cross-dressing?

09:52.040 --> 09:53.130
Is that your thing, now?

09:53.130 --> 09:54.110
No, it's not!

09:55.230 --> 09:57.570
I don't expect you to understand, but...

09:58.960 --> 10:00.030
...that's the jist of it.

10:00.610 --> 10:04.510
I'm still a little fuzzy, but it basically sounds like your mother's got a screw loose.

10:04.510 --> 10:07.000
As long as you understand that much.

10:07.670 --> 10:11.510
Well you know, everyone's worried
about you, so get back to work.

10:12.010 --> 10:13.280
But...

10:13.280 --> 10:15.210
You just don't want her seeing you in drag, right?

10:15.210 --> 10:15.970
Right.

10:16.310 --> 10:18.450
Well, I'll see what I can do.

10:18.450 --> 10:22.930
Parents are important,
but you're a good worker.

10:22.930 --> 10:25.010
I think I can give you some leeway.

10:26.480 --> 10:28.230
Thank you, Manager!

10:28.560 --> 10:31.540
I'll be sure to bring you some of my homemade macarons!

10:31.540 --> 10:32.440
Are you actually a girl?

10:34.720 --> 10:36.310
Katanashi-kun!

10:36.310 --> 10:37.430
Long time no see.

10:37.430 --> 10:40.620
Thank goodness!
You're able to work again, huh?

10:40.620 --> 10:42.410
Yes, thanks to the Manager.

10:42.410 --> 10:45.620
So Kyouko-san rewarded your hard work.

10:45.620 --> 10:48.790
That's right. It was a first.

10:49.370 --> 10:53.180
She made it so I can come in an hour
earlier and leave an hour later!

10:53.180 --> 10:55.350
That's the opposite of a reward!

10:56.010 --> 10:56.170
I won't see you for a while

10:57.120 --> 10:58.970
Damn it, Kozue...

10:59.460 --> 11:03.800
Ever since I got this text, she hasn't answered any of my calls or shown up at her usual haunts.

11:03.800 --> 11:05.840
She said she can't see us for a while,

11:05.840 --> 11:07.180
so let's just wait.

11:07.180 --> 11:08.550
Are you an idiot!?

11:08.550 --> 11:10.470
Something must've happened, obviously!

11:10.470 --> 11:13.380
We're talking about Kozue here, that clingy drunk!

11:13.380 --> 11:15.360
There's no way she wouldn't contact us!

11:15.360 --> 11:18.370
<i>You're the one being clingy right now, Mitsuki.</i>

11:19.520 --> 11:21.320
Knowing her, she'll fall out of the sky any time—

11:21.320 --> 11:22.820
Darling!

11:22.820 --> 11:23.570
Like that!

11:24.070 --> 11:26.540
I got lonely, so I came to see you.

11:26.540 --> 11:29.030
What have you been doing this whole time!?

11:29.620 --> 11:32.430
My mom's come back home,

11:32.430 --> 11:35.370
but she doesn't even remember my name.

11:35.120 --> 11:37.590
It's Kozue! Kozue!

11:35.370 --> 11:38.860
I ditched you guys so I could focus on getting her to remember me.

11:38.860 --> 11:40.080
Uh-huh.

11:40.080 --> 11:41.260
But it didn't work.

11:41.260 --> 11:42.300
<i>Seriously?</i>

11:42.670 --> 11:43.660
Forget her!

11:43.660 --> 11:46.180
I'll live with Darling and Mikki!

11:46.180 --> 11:48.420
You twins are awesome!
Let's go drinking!

11:48.420 --> 11:49.270
O-Okay.

11:50.260 --> 11:52.550
But why can't she remember?

11:53.050 --> 11:55.760
<i>Is that why she's always bothering us?</i>

11:57.310 --> 11:58.950
You two go on ahead.

11:58.950 --> 11:59.820
O-Okay.

12:02.700 --> 12:04.070
I'm coming in.

12:05.910 --> 12:06.990
It's Kozue!

12:07.430 --> 12:09.750
Her name is Kozue! Kozue!

12:09.750 --> 12:13.020
At least remember your own kid's name! It's pathetic!

12:17.380 --> 12:19.100
Wonderful!

12:19.100 --> 12:21.280
Your request is duly noted.

12:21.280 --> 12:22.730
E-Excuse me?

12:22.730 --> 12:24.530
What's your name?

12:24.530 --> 12:26.260
M-Mashiba Mitsuki.

12:26.950 --> 12:29.860
Mashiba Mitsuki-san, huh?
I'll remember it.

12:29.860 --> 12:32.470
<i>She remembered me instead of Kozue.</i>

12:33.770 --> 12:35.150
Thanks for your time!

12:35.150 --> 12:36.210
Was that Mitsuki-san?

12:36.210 --> 12:38.400
It's always nice to see some honesty.

12:39.570 --> 12:42.850
As a politician, you always deal with liars. It's disgusting.

12:42.850 --> 12:44.490
Honesty is the best policy.

12:45.190 --> 12:48.450
Liars will end up like you, Souta.

12:49.550 --> 12:51.750
What's this? No counter?

12:53.920 --> 12:57.200
You really are adorable as a girl.

12:57.200 --> 12:58.260
Shut up.

12:59.470 --> 13:02.260
I'm home...

13:03.420 --> 13:05.360
You're dead drunk.

13:05.360 --> 13:09.570
Oh, I was drinking with Mikki and Darling.

13:09.570 --> 13:11.310
Yeah, yeah...

13:11.930 --> 13:13.480
Welcome home, Kozue.

13:17.060 --> 13:18.480
Good for you, Kozue-neesan.

13:20.300 --> 13:22.700
<i>Mom finally remembers her name and she doesn't even notice.</i>

13:24.240 --> 13:25.780
Look at this!

13:25.780 --> 13:28.460
That's Takanashi-san's mother

13:28.460 --> 13:30.500
being played by Yamada's mother.

13:30.500 --> 13:31.490
What?

13:32.120 --> 13:34.460
She's disguised as my mother.

13:35.050 --> 13:36.100
Seriously?

13:36.100 --> 13:38.090
Politicians are a scary lot.

13:38.090 --> 13:39.360
It's fine.

13:39.360 --> 13:42.090
In fact, it sounds like her approval
rating has actually gone up a bit.

13:42.090 --> 13:44.380
Shouldn't that be kind of concerning?

13:44.780 --> 13:46.590
I'm sorry, Yamada.

13:46.590 --> 13:50.350
Your mother has to leave you all alone just because she's Mom's secretary.

13:50.350 --> 13:52.540
It's her job, no point complaining.

13:52.540 --> 13:55.820
And Yamada has Wagnaria,
so she's not lonely at all.

13:55.820 --> 13:56.850
Yamada...

13:56.850 --> 14:00.270
Not to mention her son is bending over
backwards to help me.

14:00.270 --> 14:02.730
Is that so? I take back my apology.

14:02.730 --> 14:05.940
Yamada is getting along with
her mother more and more,

14:05.940 --> 14:08.310
and things are good with her brother as well.

14:08.310 --> 14:09.070
Right, Souma-onii—

14:09.070 --> 14:11.640
I'm not your brother.

14:11.640 --> 14:13.540
You didn't even let me finish the joke!

14:13.540 --> 14:15.890
Well, back to work.

14:15.890 --> 14:19.480
Souma-san, Mother gets off work early today,

14:19.480 --> 14:21.410
so she's coming here to pick Yamada up.

14:21.410 --> 14:23.390
Good for you.

14:23.390 --> 14:24.630
So, um...

14:24.630 --> 14:29.770
Uh, Yamada wants to introduce you to my mother.

14:29.770 --> 14:30.590
That's okay, right?

14:32.340 --> 14:33.970
You look paler than driven snow!

14:33.970 --> 14:35.850
You're Snowma-san!

14:36.170 --> 14:39.530
A young girl wants to introduce her parent to a man...

14:39.530 --> 14:41.330
It's like you're getting married.

14:41.330 --> 14:42.310
Could you stop?

14:42.310 --> 14:43.900
That's enough!

14:43.900 --> 14:46.890
That's not the relationship
Yamada and Souma-san have!

14:46.890 --> 14:50.940
If we got married, Yamada would
become Souma Yamada...

14:50.940 --> 14:53.820
Or would Souma-san become Yamada?

14:53.820 --> 14:55.480
Then Yamada would become Souma-san...

14:55.480 --> 14:57.700
Yama... Yamada Souma-Yamada...

14:57.700 --> 15:00.080
then Souma-san-Yamada...

15:01.350 --> 15:02.080
He's gone!

15:02.540 --> 15:04.550
Souma-san! Where are you!?

15:06.750 --> 15:09.240
Why would he run off?

15:09.240 --> 15:11.220
Does he hate Yamada?

15:11.810 --> 15:13.120
"Poor girl."

15:13.120 --> 15:16.180
"I'm gonna go over there right now and declare myself to be her big brother."

15:16.180 --> 15:18.180
Would you not put words into my mouth?

15:18.180 --> 15:20.930
What's the big deal? You're just meeting her mom.

15:20.930 --> 15:22.680
She'll probably just thank you.

15:22.680 --> 15:23.650
But...

15:24.180 --> 15:27.610
Yamada looks up to you in her own way. She's grateful, too.

15:29.070 --> 15:31.280
First I'll try luring him with natto.

15:31.830 --> 15:35.730
I'd expect a less lame trap from someone who looks up to me.

15:35.730 --> 15:38.120
Well that's... you know.

15:38.520 --> 15:40.540
Still...

15:40.540 --> 15:41.370
Well, good luck.

15:41.900 --> 15:45.840
Satou-kun! Jeez, abandoning me like that...

15:45.840 --> 15:47.510
Yamada is caught in her own trap!

15:47.510 --> 15:48.550
Help!

15:48.550 --> 15:50.320
What are you doing!?

15:51.840 --> 15:54.020
I-It actually worked.

15:54.020 --> 15:55.600
It's even lamer than I thought!

15:56.000 --> 15:58.570
Come on! Why did you run away?

15:58.570 --> 16:01.110
Are you embarrassed to meet my mother?

16:01.110 --> 16:02.840
Well, that's part of it.

16:02.840 --> 16:05.060
She's a serious person, so...

16:08.100 --> 16:09.820
It's Yamada's mother!

16:10.130 --> 16:13.530
Mom, this is the big brother Yamada loves!

16:14.150 --> 16:15.820
I had another son and didn't know it?

16:16.560 --> 16:18.990
That's exactly how I figured you'd react.

16:18.990 --> 16:21.960
No, no. This is Souma-oniichan.

16:22.280 --> 16:23.850
We're not related by blood,

16:23.850 --> 16:25.880
but he's a good big brother,

16:25.880 --> 16:29.050
better than Yamada's real big brother.

16:29.470 --> 16:30.660
Aoi...

16:31.320 --> 16:33.340
Our last name isn't Yamada.

16:34.160 --> 16:37.720
That's right. Then Souma-san is the only Yamada?

16:37.720 --> 16:39.680
Yamada-san, aren't you going home?

16:39.680 --> 16:42.020
That's right!
Yamada will change first!

16:43.190 --> 16:45.900
But you must be happy,
having your daughter back home.

16:47.560 --> 16:49.240
<i>Or not?</i>

16:49.850 --> 16:52.110
Aoi and Kirio...

16:52.110 --> 16:55.410
Oh, you're worried about them getting along?

16:56.150 --> 16:57.430
Well, Yamada-san...

16:58.030 --> 17:00.120
I mean Aoi-san's a teenager.

17:00.470 --> 17:04.650
It's common for girls at that age to have contempt for their brothers.

17:04.650 --> 17:07.670
<i>Why am I giving parenting advice?</i>

17:08.950 --> 17:11.050
Those two will be fine.

17:11.050 --> 17:11.880
See for yourself.

17:15.810 --> 17:16.720
Hold on.

17:16.720 --> 17:19.510
She may look obviously disgusted, but... just hold on.

17:19.960 --> 17:21.640
Yamada is an adult.

17:21.640 --> 17:25.730
Yamada doesn't want Mom to worry,
so today she'll call him Brother Dearest!

17:27.230 --> 17:28.690
Inami-san!

17:29.000 --> 17:31.540
Oh, Kirio-kun. What's up?

17:31.540 --> 17:33.970
Inami-san, where's Aoi?

17:33.970 --> 17:35.400
Yamada-san?

17:35.400 --> 17:38.750
Her shift is over, so she's
probably in the break room...

17:39.970 --> 17:41.720
Aoi, it's your big brother!

17:41.720 --> 17:42.710
Not to Yamada!

17:42.710 --> 17:43.620
Why!?

17:44.530 --> 17:47.090
As you can see, that farce plays out quite often.

17:47.090 --> 17:49.080
But it won't be that way forever.

17:49.500 --> 17:51.190
Souma-san, Mom!

17:51.190 --> 17:53.330
Aoi won't recognize me as her big brother!

17:53.330 --> 17:54.840
He's a bad person!

17:56.490 --> 17:57.380
Mom...

17:57.380 --> 17:59.710
Aoi, Mom is pleased.

17:59.710 --> 18:01.150
I don't know why, though.

18:01.150 --> 18:02.560
You don't have to say that.

18:02.560 --> 18:04.860
Yamada could see it on her own.

18:05.520 --> 18:06.560
Good grief...

18:06.940 --> 18:08.240
Had enough?

18:08.240 --> 18:11.060
Well, the rest is all in the family.

18:11.760 --> 18:14.610
They're not perfect,
but I think they're a nice family.

18:15.380 --> 18:17.780
That was actually kind of heartwarming.

18:18.170 --> 18:19.490
I see.

18:19.800 --> 18:21.400
Here's some cold medicine.

18:21.400 --> 18:22.950
I'm not sick.

18:23.320 --> 18:26.330
I'm glad Takanashi-kun is able to work again.

18:27.370 --> 18:28.290
Yeah.

18:28.290 --> 18:31.290
Though it looks like he still has some issues to work out.

18:31.290 --> 18:32.430
Yeah.

18:32.430 --> 18:33.800
What's wrong, Inami-chan?

18:34.390 --> 18:37.180
Aren't you glad Katanashi-kun is back?

18:37.180 --> 18:38.630
Th-That's not it!

18:39.200 --> 18:42.630
It's just that I haven't actually seen him yet.

18:42.630 --> 18:45.070
Not once since he's been back?

18:46.600 --> 18:52.450
Come to think of it, Takanashi-kun did make some requests to Kyouko-san about his shift times.

18:52.450 --> 18:54.950
M-Maybe he's avoiding me.

18:54.950 --> 18:56.840
Th-That can't be it!

18:56.840 --> 18:57.970
It's a coincidence!

18:57.970 --> 19:01.280
Even though we both have a lot of shifts?

19:01.280 --> 19:02.880
J-Just a coincidence!

19:02.880 --> 19:07.000
That's right. Like Popura-chan said,
he's still working through some issues!

19:07.530 --> 19:09.120
I'm not so sure...

19:09.490 --> 19:10.650
I am!

19:10.650 --> 19:14.880
After all, sometimes Katanashi-kun gets this miserable look.

19:14.880 --> 19:17.860
It's just like a girl in love...

19:17.860 --> 19:20.840
<i>Or maybe a boy in drag?</i>

19:21.600 --> 19:25.020
<i>No, I think I'm the cause.</i>

19:25.630 --> 19:26.810
<i>But I don't blame him.</i>

19:27.320 --> 19:28.770
<i>What can I do?</i>

19:29.180 --> 19:32.270
<i>In that case, I'll have to ask her directly!</i>

19:30.750 --> 19:32.270
Kyouko-san!

19:35.230 --> 19:37.410
I never thought a man-hater like you

19:37.410 --> 19:40.160
would ask to share shifts with a particular man.

19:41.750 --> 19:43.620
You've changed, Inami.

19:44.140 --> 19:46.230
I can't make sudden changes to the shifts,

19:46.230 --> 19:48.330
but I'll tell you Takanashi's hours for tomorrow.

19:48.330 --> 19:50.580
You can meet him after work.

19:49.810 --> 19:50.580
Kyouko-san!

19:50.950 --> 19:55.610
Besides, it's been a pain arranging
the shifts to keep you two apart.

19:55.610 --> 19:58.340
You haven't changed, Kyouko-san.

19:59.250 --> 20:00.840
Have a good night!

20:02.550 --> 20:05.010
It's a relief not having to cross-dress when I'm at school...

20:10.250 --> 20:11.640
Inami-san?

20:11.640 --> 20:14.570
I-I was lying in wait!

20:14.570 --> 20:18.120
Th-That line sounds really cute coming from you,

20:18.120 --> 20:19.990
but why are you standing like that?

20:19.990 --> 20:22.900
I-It's so I can stop you from escaping.

20:22.900 --> 20:23.740
Hehehe.

20:23.740 --> 20:25.120
<i>Were you trying to kidnap me?</i>

20:25.990 --> 20:27.900
I'm sorry, Inami-san.

20:27.900 --> 20:28.830
For avoiding you...

20:29.470 --> 20:31.480
I'm a jerk.

20:32.190 --> 20:33.290
Takanashi-kun...

20:34.020 --> 20:36.290
I can't decide when to be honest,

20:36.290 --> 20:38.500
or when to stop crossdressing,

20:38.500 --> 20:41.590
and I'm not able to come to terms with my feelings...

20:43.030 --> 20:45.760
I haven't been much of a man.

20:46.240 --> 20:49.220
Though my fondness for small things has not wavered at all.

20:49.220 --> 20:51.980
Takanashi-kun, let's leave that aside for the moment.

20:52.950 --> 20:54.420
Takanashi-kun...

20:56.570 --> 20:57.440
You <i>are</i> manly!

20:58.250 --> 20:59.150
Inami-san...

20:59.940 --> 21:04.820
You were so cool telling my father off
when he came to the restaurant.

21:04.820 --> 21:08.160
Even a man-hater like me was moved by it!

21:09.010 --> 21:10.960
I was cross-dressing at the time, though.

21:10.960 --> 21:12.650
T-True.

21:13.250 --> 21:17.210
But... that doesn't matter!

21:17.650 --> 21:19.950
And manliness has nothing to do with it either!

21:19.950 --> 21:21.980
You're cool, Takanashi-kun!

21:23.860 --> 21:27.610
But since I can grab you,
maybe you're not so manly after all!

21:27.610 --> 21:29.070
Please calm down.

21:30.220 --> 21:31.720
S-Sorry.

21:34.700 --> 21:36.440
Thank you, Inami-san.

21:36.860 --> 21:38.690
You're doing your best...

21:39.310 --> 21:42.610
so I need to do the same.

21:43.630 --> 21:45.980
I won't lie to myself about my own feelings!

21:45.980 --> 21:48.780
It'd be nice if you didn't lie to your own mother, either.

21:48.780 --> 21:49.740
Mom—!

21:51.060 --> 21:53.950
I told you I hate liars!

21:54.460 --> 21:56.650
You're just like your father!

21:56.650 --> 22:00.130
I can't let a son like that date anyone.

22:06.060 --> 22:08.010
Katanashi-kun is quitting!?

22:08.010 --> 22:09.470
W-Why?

22:09.950 --> 22:13.680
Well, that's what his mother decided, so...

22:14.140 --> 22:17.440
Um, I'd like to talk to <i>him</i> about it, though.

22:17.440 --> 22:23.400
He's a high school student,
so if his guardian says no, that's that.

22:23.730 --> 22:26.670
Wh-What about Katanashi-kun's feelings!?

22:26.670 --> 22:27.920
Beats me.

22:27.920 --> 22:29.660
Let us see Takanashi-san!

22:29.660 --> 22:31.160
No can do!

22:31.160 --> 22:33.180
That's tyranny! You're terrible! And a meanie!

22:33.180 --> 22:34.960
And an ogre! And a demon!

22:35.620 --> 22:39.120
Don't get carried away, he enjoys it.

22:40.870 --> 22:44.480
Sorry, but I'm already spoken for.

22:44.480 --> 22:46.090
I'm not going to hit you!

22:46.620 --> 22:49.550
If you have any complaints,
please direct them to his mother.

22:49.550 --> 22:54.340
But be aware that doing so has its dangers.

22:54.340 --> 22:55.350
Good day.

22:57.420 --> 23:00.150
I can't believe Katanashi-kun is quitting.

23:00.150 --> 23:02.480
I-It must be my fault.

23:02.860 --> 23:04.880
I was talking to Takanashi-kun

23:04.880 --> 23:08.060
when his mother dragged him home.

23:08.060 --> 23:11.040
I guess she didn't like me.

23:11.040 --> 23:11.950
That's not it.

23:12.270 --> 23:13.080
The opposite.

23:13.080 --> 23:14.360
The opposite?

23:14.360 --> 23:16.950
Takanashi told me before over the phone...

23:19.240 --> 23:19.910
So...

23:20.620 --> 23:23.040
how long do I have to dress up as a girl?

23:23.700 --> 23:25.880
Until you stop being a liar.

23:26.960 --> 23:31.510
I've told you repeatedly to not lie and be true to your feelings.

23:31.510 --> 23:33.900
I hear there's a girl you like.

23:33.900 --> 23:35.600
Y-You heard wrong.

23:35.840 --> 23:40.810
I guess... my dad finally gave us his blessing,

23:40.810 --> 23:42.010
but I wonder if it is okay...

23:42.830 --> 23:44.060
It's not okay!

23:44.060 --> 23:47.150
Lies, lies, and more lies!

23:47.830 --> 23:49.740
You really are just like your father!

23:53.290 --> 23:54.320
Takanashi-kun.

23:55.120 --> 23:57.940
There's something I've always wanted to tell you.

23:57.940 --> 23:59.290
What is it, Shizuka?

23:59.770 --> 24:02.750
I-I love you. Please go out with me!

24:03.760 --> 24:09.490
I-I'm a short girl, just like you prefer. So can we?

24:09.490 --> 24:12.710
N-N-No way!

24:12.710 --> 24:15.140
I like tall, mature girls!

24:17.280 --> 24:22.400
Through sheer willpower I grew taller, only to find out that he was lying.

24:22.400 --> 24:23.730
But that was...

24:24.060 --> 24:26.560
Men who lie are no good!

24:26.560 --> 24:28.550
They destroy women's lives!

24:29.090 --> 24:34.110
Deceitful men don't deserve to have a girlfriend <i>or</i> their manhood.

24:34.560 --> 24:38.360
C-Come on, you can forgive me for being a little shy with my feelings.

24:38.360 --> 24:39.490
Forget it.

24:40.060 --> 24:42.910
I despise liars!

24:42.910 --> 24:45.290
He said he wasn't going to die, and then he died.

24:45.290 --> 24:47.210
You really ought to forgive him for that.

24:47.780 --> 24:49.420
And there you have it.

24:50.550 --> 24:54.280
Then Katanashi-kun is being forced to quit...

24:54.280 --> 24:56.890
...because he wasn't being honest with Inami-san?

24:57.210 --> 25:00.920
Th-Then it really is my fault.

25:01.600 --> 25:04.470
I'm sorry for causing so much trouble!

25:04.470 --> 25:06.310
You look happy, Inami-chan!

25:06.310 --> 25:11.940
A-Anyway, I'll go to Takanashi-kun's house and talk to his mother!

25:12.380 --> 25:14.480
Wait, Inami-san!

25:14.480 --> 25:17.620
That guy said it could be dangerous.

25:17.620 --> 25:19.860
If you go, then we should make sure you're prepared.

25:19.860 --> 25:21.160
What do you mean?

25:22.080 --> 25:25.170
Just as I thought, Takanashi-san's uniform looks great on you.

25:25.170 --> 25:27.920
You even went as far as to wrap up your chest!

25:27.920 --> 25:29.170
No, I didn't.

25:30.000 --> 25:31.500
Inami.

25:31.500 --> 25:34.590
Bring back my precious labor!

25:35.070 --> 25:36.090
Right!

25:36.540 --> 25:39.320
Be careful. The mother is apparently strange.

25:39.320 --> 25:40.050
Understood.

25:40.450 --> 25:41.260
Here.

25:42.000 --> 25:44.640
Give this to Takanashi-kun's little sister.

25:45.240 --> 25:46.140
O-Okay...

25:47.750 --> 25:48.790
Yachiyo...

25:48.790 --> 25:50.060
But it's supposed to be dangerous.

25:57.140 --> 26:00.290
<i>What did he mean by "dangerous"?</i>

26:00.910 --> 26:02.080
Good evening.

26:03.380 --> 26:05.040
Takanashi-kun's big sister!

26:05.040 --> 26:08.000
I-I was just on my way to your house.

26:08.350 --> 26:12.060
Is that so? Unfortunately, I can't let you pass.

26:12.060 --> 26:17.600
Our mother has ordered us four
Takanashi sisters to engage you.

26:17.600 --> 26:21.610
If you wish to see Souta and our mother,
you'll have to defeat all of us.

26:21.610 --> 26:23.680
Now, let's have a fair fight!

26:24.140 --> 26:25.890
<i>Th-This is...</i>

26:26.220 --> 26:28.100
So embarrassing!

26:28.540 --> 26:34.430
It's embarrassing, but I can't let our shame spread to outsiders any more than it already has!

26:35.220 --> 26:36.950
I hope you understand.

26:38.020 --> 26:39.030
Right...

26:40.350 --> 26:42.950
Congratulations on your remarriage!

26:45.560 --> 26:46.540
I lost.

26:48.550 --> 26:50.750
She lost the will to fight?

26:53.400 --> 26:55.500
Then I have to defeat three more people

26:55.500 --> 26:58.170
by the time I get to Takanashi-kun's house?

26:58.170 --> 27:00.260
Kozue-san, Nazuna-chan...

27:01.320 --> 27:03.220
Don't tell me the last person is...

27:04.770 --> 27:06.720
Good evening...

27:06.720 --> 27:08.140
<i>She already looks defeated!</i>

27:08.140 --> 27:10.100
I-I'm sorry.

27:10.100 --> 27:12.460
Waiting really tired me out.

27:12.460 --> 27:15.290
Let me reintroduce myself.

27:15.290 --> 27:19.400
I'm Takanashi Izumi, the second daughter.

27:19.400 --> 27:21.820
I-I'm Inami Mahiru.

27:21.820 --> 27:23.490
Mahiru-chan...

27:23.490 --> 27:25.320
I'm so happy

27:25.320 --> 27:30.370
that the girl I thought would be perfect as Sou-chan's girlfriend likes him.

27:30.820 --> 27:35.300
And to think that it would be you,
who said you would care for me...

27:35.300 --> 27:37.840
<i>I should watch what I say.</i>

27:37.840 --> 27:40.500
I'm cheering you two on.

27:40.500 --> 27:41.960
Really?

27:41.960 --> 27:42.840
Yes.

27:43.130 --> 27:44.490
<i>Good.</i>

27:44.490 --> 27:47.480
<i>Because if we fought, it would be dangerous...</i>

27:48.070 --> 27:49.640
<i>for her.</i>

27:50.240 --> 27:51.100
Then...

27:51.680 --> 27:52.560
Yes?

27:52.560 --> 27:55.020
Go to town on me.

27:56.750 --> 27:59.690
I'm prepared to die for you two.

28:00.000 --> 28:02.030
<i>I'm not prepared to kill you!</i>

28:04.500 --> 28:09.040
Th-Then I'll give you
a light forehead flick.

28:12.930 --> 28:14.040
You got me.

28:14.040 --> 28:15.300
I didn't touch you yet!

28:15.300 --> 28:16.860
A-Are you okay!?

28:16.860 --> 28:18.190
What should I do?

28:18.190 --> 28:21.430
And I'm sure the other two are waiting.

28:21.430 --> 28:23.260
Why, if it isn't Inami-san!

28:24.120 --> 28:27.830
I was on my way to the restaurant,
but what are you up to, Inami-san?

28:27.830 --> 28:29.150
Yamada-kun?

28:30.350 --> 28:34.190
I see. I'll carry her to Takanashi-kun's house.

28:34.190 --> 28:34.940
Are you sure?

28:34.940 --> 28:38.440
Yeah. I love beautiful girls,
but also beautiful women.

28:38.850 --> 28:40.280
<i>On second thought...</i>

28:41.650 --> 28:43.190
Thank you!

28:43.190 --> 28:44.680
Good luck, Inami-san!

28:44.680 --> 28:46.770
Tell Takanashi-kun I said hi!

28:46.770 --> 28:51.710
Be happy, my first love and the person
I've fallen in love with recently.

28:55.540 --> 28:57.340
Hey there, Matsumoto-san!

29:06.390 --> 29:07.910
Inami-chan!

29:10.080 --> 29:11.350
Kozue-san!

29:11.350 --> 29:13.530
I'm up next.

29:13.530 --> 29:16.440
But obviously, I'm on your side.

29:16.440 --> 29:18.570
Thank you.

29:18.570 --> 29:20.650
Still, I think this'll be fun, so let's throw down!

29:21.040 --> 29:22.900
<i>I guess I still have to fight.</i>

29:23.340 --> 29:25.460
I hope Takanashi-kun is okay.

29:25.460 --> 29:26.610
Mahiru-chan too.

29:27.160 --> 29:29.580
Takanashi's been through a lot.

29:29.580 --> 29:32.790
I haven't been any help...

29:32.790 --> 29:38.400
If I were little and cute, maybe I would have been able to soothe him.

29:38.400 --> 29:41.090
Well, you may not be little...

29:41.090 --> 29:45.860
"You may not be little, but you <i>are</i> cute!"
is what Satou-kun wants to say!

29:51.520 --> 29:54.940
Maybe you're only tough against male opponents, Inami-chan?

29:55.960 --> 29:59.230
You're gonna have to do better than that if you want to get past me.

29:59.690 --> 30:02.020
<i>What should I do? At this rate...</i>

30:02.020 --> 30:04.950
<i>Takanashi-kun, lend me your strength!</i>

30:04.950 --> 30:05.700
Kozue!

30:06.440 --> 30:09.780
You said you'd make dinner tonight,
so we've been waiting for you.

30:09.780 --> 30:11.200
What the hell are you doing here?

30:11.700 --> 30:13.680
Mikki, Darling!

30:13.680 --> 30:15.500
I totally forgot!

30:15.500 --> 30:16.710
I'll get right to it!

30:16.710 --> 30:17.700
U-Um...

30:17.700 --> 30:20.480
Oh Inami-chan, we can just call it here, I lost.

30:22.170 --> 30:24.630
I won?

30:24.960 --> 30:28.340
Yachiyo, you <i>have</i> helped him.

30:29.550 --> 30:31.140
Takanashi told me before...

30:32.730 --> 30:39.150
Man, life's gotten a lot easier for me thanks to Mitsuki-san and Kouhei-san hanging out with Kozue-neechan.

30:39.850 --> 30:43.360
I'm grateful to the manager and Chief.

30:43.720 --> 30:44.550
That's what he said.

30:44.550 --> 30:47.110
I'm happy to be of any help.

30:47.410 --> 30:49.740
<i>I wonder if that will be of any help too.</i>

30:51.440 --> 30:53.620
<i>Nazuna-chan's the last one.</i>

30:53.620 --> 30:57.930
<i>But maybe she'll just let me pass.</i>

30:57.930 --> 30:58.750
Inami-san.

30:58.750 --> 31:00.230
Nazuna-chan!

31:01.660 --> 31:03.630
You're not getting by me.

31:03.630 --> 31:04.920
She's into it!

31:05.250 --> 31:07.130
Inami-san, I'm very ticked off right now.

31:08.230 --> 31:10.620
Nazuna-chan, I think you might be misunderstand—

31:11.190 --> 31:15.390
I thought you were hitting my brother
to satisfy his masochism.

31:15.890 --> 31:18.180
But it turns out you were hitting him for no reason at all.

31:18.570 --> 31:19.850
<i>I was right!</i>

31:20.270 --> 31:22.410
If you deny this charge, please say so now.

31:22.410 --> 31:25.030
You have every right to be angry!

31:25.030 --> 31:26.820
That's not a denial.

31:27.260 --> 31:30.830
I won't forgive anyone who hurts my brother!

31:30.830 --> 31:32.610
If you want to get past me,

31:32.610 --> 31:35.030
you're gonna have to do it the hard way.

31:35.370 --> 31:36.550
Here I come!

31:37.930 --> 31:39.200
<i>Wh-What should I do?</i>

31:39.200 --> 31:41.840
<i>Do I really have to beat up Nazuna-chan?</i>

31:41.840 --> 31:44.790
<i>Although, even if she is a super grade-schooler,</i>

31:44.790 --> 31:46.450
<i>she's no Kozue-san.</i>

31:46.450 --> 31:47.420
<i>I could easily knock her—</i>

31:47.420 --> 31:48.980
I can't do it!

31:48.980 --> 31:50.010
What's wrong?

31:50.340 --> 31:51.730
I can't hit you!

31:51.730 --> 31:55.050
Takanashi-kun risked his life to cure me!

31:55.600 --> 31:59.580
I can't hit his beloved little sister!

32:00.300 --> 32:02.650
I don't want to hit <i>anyone.</i>

32:04.330 --> 32:06.610
Well if you won't attack, I will.

32:11.080 --> 32:14.990
Sorry. This was just a test, Inami-san.

32:15.700 --> 32:18.790
As I thought, you're a nice person.

32:18.790 --> 32:24.500
I think that's why my brother did
his best to endure your punches.

32:24.850 --> 32:26.340
Nazuna-chan...

32:27.240 --> 32:28.690
But I'm relieved.

32:28.690 --> 32:30.880
I wasn't sure what I was
going to do if you actually hit me.

32:30.880 --> 32:33.790
Or rather, I was thinking about how I'd get you back.

32:34.580 --> 32:35.300
<i>That's scary.</i>

32:35.660 --> 32:36.680
Oh, that's right.

32:37.510 --> 32:39.640
This is from Souma-san.

32:40.600 --> 32:43.190
Yamada is going to help Inami-san!

32:43.510 --> 32:45.420
Don't, you'll just get in the way.

32:45.420 --> 32:47.940
Yamada wants to help both of them!

32:48.450 --> 32:50.690
You're already being helpful, so relax.

32:51.670 --> 32:53.430
What do you mean?

32:53.430 --> 32:56.700
Is Yamada's cuteness soothing everyone?

32:56.700 --> 32:58.080
Yeah, that.

32:58.080 --> 33:01.040
I was setting you up for a putdown!

33:03.330 --> 33:04.000
Now then...

33:04.680 --> 33:08.930
I wonder how I should get what
Takanashi-kun's little sister asked for.

33:08.930 --> 33:10.760
This is a politician we're talking about.

33:11.530 --> 33:15.260
I'll think about it while eating the sweets from Yamada-san's mother.

33:15.510 --> 33:19.890
Thank you so much for taking care of Aoi.

33:19.890 --> 33:25.020
As a token of my gratitude, I'm giving you something that Aoi says you'll enjoy.

33:25.020 --> 33:28.710
I hope it makes a fine addition to your collection.

33:29.350 --> 33:30.730
Something I'll enjoy?

33:31.160 --> 33:35.990
I obtained something very useful
thanks to you, Yamada-san.

33:37.470 --> 33:38.320
Let's go.

33:38.320 --> 33:40.490
S-Sure. But is this okay for you?

33:41.170 --> 33:44.250
I'm on your side, Mahiru-oneechan.

33:44.250 --> 33:46.420
<i>O-Onee-chan!</i>

33:47.990 --> 33:50.290
<i>My new big sister's just as easy as the others.</i>

33:53.170 --> 33:54.170
Inami-san?

33:54.490 --> 33:57.010
Yes. Apparently she's coming
here to talk to me directly.

33:57.760 --> 33:59.550
Don't involve Inami-san in your shenanigans!

33:59.550 --> 34:03.020
You have nobody to blame for these "shenanigans" but yourself, Souta!

34:03.020 --> 34:04.370
You're a tyrant!

34:04.370 --> 34:07.840
And <i>you</i> should be ashamed of yourself, needing a girl to come rescue you!

34:11.700 --> 34:13.270
Pardon me!

34:13.270 --> 34:14.490
Huh? A boy?

34:14.930 --> 34:16.460
Excuse me.

34:16.460 --> 34:17.860
My name is Inami Mahiru.

34:20.160 --> 34:21.580
You're dressed as a boy.

34:22.110 --> 34:25.420
Mom, she beat all of us.

34:26.550 --> 34:29.040
Oh. You're all worthless.

34:29.380 --> 34:31.670
Takanashi-kun, are you okay?

34:31.670 --> 34:32.500
Inami-san...

34:33.640 --> 34:35.460
<i>It's one of those moving reunions.</i>

34:37.500 --> 34:40.470
<i>I see all kinds of gender reversals here.</i>

34:40.930 --> 34:43.720
U-Um, Takanashi-kun's mother...

34:43.720 --> 34:48.100
Takanashi-kun is such a tough nut to crack

34:48.600 --> 34:52.400
that I don't know how he feels about me,

34:53.080 --> 34:55.250
but to cure my androphobia,

34:55.250 --> 34:59.110
he endured countless punches
from me and told off my father.

34:59.810 --> 35:02.300
I think he's a very upstanding person.

35:02.850 --> 35:06.180
So I want to continue working with him!

35:06.180 --> 35:07.660
I want to be with him!

35:08.240 --> 35:10.330
Please don't make him quit his job.

35:11.030 --> 35:12.580
Okay, I've heard her piece.

35:12.580 --> 35:13.840
What about you, Souta?

35:13.840 --> 35:15.800
Huh? Uh...

35:16.210 --> 35:17.750
Quit beating around the bush!

35:17.750 --> 35:19.170
If you'd just be more honest,

35:19.170 --> 35:22.020
I wouldn't have to worry about you like this!

35:22.020 --> 35:23.510
Easy, Mom.

35:23.510 --> 35:26.850
You can't expect him to just immediately put everything out there.

35:27.370 --> 35:30.620
He should just do his best
to work on it from now on, right?

35:30.620 --> 35:32.060
That's how people change.

35:32.510 --> 35:36.120
You used to be like this, Mom, but you changed.

35:36.120 --> 35:37.290
So you understand, right?

35:37.780 --> 35:38.970
Right?

35:38.970 --> 35:41.780
All of those photos were
in my office! How did you...?

35:42.130 --> 35:42.970
Photos?

35:42.970 --> 35:47.500
I asked Souma-san to get an old photo of Mom.

35:47.840 --> 35:49.920
I'm growing day by day, too,

35:49.920 --> 35:51.620
all so I can help Onii-chan.

35:52.340 --> 35:56.320
So if you don't want the rest of the family
and everyone else to see this photo,

35:56.320 --> 35:57.960
you'd better forgive him!

35:57.960 --> 36:01.720
I'm touched, but please don't go down that path, Nazuna!

36:02.780 --> 36:05.310
D-Do whatever you want with the photo!

36:05.310 --> 36:07.860
I don't give in to threats!

36:07.860 --> 36:10.680
I won't let him off the hook until I'm satisfied!

36:11.000 --> 36:13.430
<i>Dang... That's Mom for you.</i>

36:13.430 --> 36:15.310
<i>But one more push might...</i>

36:15.310 --> 36:16.650
<i>If I could just...</i>

36:16.650 --> 36:19.320
<i>If I could somehow...</i>

36:19.320 --> 36:22.280
<i>Anything would work.</i>

36:22.570 --> 36:23.630
Excuse me!

36:23.630 --> 36:24.240
Senpai!

36:24.240 --> 36:26.810
Katanashi-kun! Inami-chan!

36:26.810 --> 36:28.610
We were worried about you two!

36:28.610 --> 36:29.450
Is everything okay?

36:29.450 --> 36:32.300
I know we're probably intruding, but...

36:32.300 --> 36:34.960
I brought your bag and clothes, Inami-chan.

36:35.380 --> 36:37.320
This girl works with you?

36:38.160 --> 36:39.170
Good evening!

36:39.480 --> 36:44.050
Souta, you went with Inami-san over a little girl like this?

36:44.050 --> 36:45.680
I'm not little!

36:46.020 --> 36:48.640
Uh... Yeah.

36:56.570 --> 36:57.270
Darling...

36:58.020 --> 37:01.990
Souta, a nitwit like you
who is fond of little things,

37:02.410 --> 37:06.950
actually chose a normal girl over a small one.

37:06.950 --> 37:09.910
I suppose a child doesn't need a parent to grow up.

37:10.750 --> 37:12.870
Souta, I give your job my blessing.

37:12.870 --> 37:17.960
This is all very heartwarming,
but please don't use me as an offering!

37:18.380 --> 37:22.120
Inami-san, I'm sorry for the trouble I've caused you.

37:22.120 --> 37:24.480
I'm sure it was hard dealing with my sisters.

37:24.480 --> 37:26.170
Actually, no.

37:26.170 --> 37:30.050
They're the only reason I made it here.

37:30.050 --> 37:33.230
I hardly did anything.

37:34.250 --> 37:38.020
Still, I really appreciate you coming.

37:38.020 --> 37:40.900
A-And what you said earlier made me really happy.

37:45.130 --> 37:47.380
I'm grateful to you too, Senpai.

37:47.380 --> 37:48.620
Thank you very much.

37:49.100 --> 37:52.080
Jeez, don't pray to me! Do something!

37:53.200 --> 37:56.000
And so, I'm going back to work.

37:56.000 --> 37:57.400
All of you, take care.

37:57.940 --> 38:00.300
Do you have to leave in the middle of the night?

38:00.300 --> 38:02.590
I have a mountain of work to deal with.

38:03.360 --> 38:04.890
That aside, Souta.

38:04.890 --> 38:08.480
There are a number of reasons why I'm backing off for the time being.

38:08.480 --> 38:09.850
But you know what you have to do, right?

38:10.590 --> 38:12.600
Y-Yes.

38:14.710 --> 38:16.580
For now, I'll have faith in you.

38:17.660 --> 38:18.560
See you.

38:20.300 --> 38:21.520
Leave Senpai here!

38:25.680 --> 38:28.460
Sorry you ended up walking me home.

38:28.460 --> 38:29.290
Not at all.

38:30.070 --> 38:33.480
Um, Inami-san, could we stop by the park first?

38:33.950 --> 38:35.540
Sure, if you'd like...

38:38.560 --> 38:41.300
Man, the moon sure is beautiful, isn't it?

38:41.300 --> 38:43.150
It really is!

38:47.440 --> 38:49.710
I never thought I would ever spend time with y—

38:49.710 --> 38:54.430
with a man like this.

38:54.940 --> 38:57.130
I'm glad I started working.

38:59.300 --> 39:04.390
The manager always told me to get over
my fixation on little things.

39:04.950 --> 39:08.540
But the manager is the manager,
the Chief is the Chief,

39:08.540 --> 39:09.970
Yamada is Yamada,

39:09.970 --> 39:13.120
and you know how my big sisters are.

39:13.490 --> 39:16.790
Only my teeny-tiny Senpai could soothe my soul.

39:17.280 --> 39:18.580
Little things are wonderful!

39:19.340 --> 39:22.500
Y-You haven't changed either, Takanashi-kun.

39:23.020 --> 39:26.490
It's important to change, like you have, Inami-san,

39:26.490 --> 39:28.680
but I also think some things are better off the same.

39:29.320 --> 39:32.630
My ability to be openly fond of little things is important to me.

39:33.240 --> 39:34.470
It's my strong point!

39:34.840 --> 39:37.170
R-Right.

39:37.170 --> 39:43.080
<i>I may be wrong, but is he rejecting me indirectly?</i>

39:49.700 --> 39:53.740
My strong point is being able to say
that I love the things I love.

40:06.100 --> 40:07.560
Inami-san...

40:08.300 --> 40:09.300
I love you.

40:18.490 --> 40:20.770
I-Inami-san?

40:22.250 --> 40:24.160
T-T-T-Takanashi-kun...

40:25.360 --> 40:27.200
A-Actually...

40:27.200 --> 40:29.060
Actually, I love you too!

40:29.060 --> 40:31.360
I, uh... already know.

40:31.680 --> 40:34.430
Uh... um... why?

40:34.430 --> 40:35.870
Why what?

40:36.250 --> 40:38.690
Um... What do you like about me?

40:38.690 --> 40:42.220
Wh-What...? Lots of stuff.

40:42.220 --> 40:45.260
Like how you always give everything your best shot.

40:45.260 --> 40:49.130
And, uh, how you make me want to protect you...

40:49.700 --> 40:53.030
Although that might overlap with my love of little things.

40:53.030 --> 40:54.970
M-M-M-Maybe, yeah...

40:54.970 --> 40:56.660
I guess so...

40:56.660 --> 40:59.070
That must be it! Since my chest is so small!

40:59.070 --> 41:00.140
Inami-san, calm down!

41:02.880 --> 41:04.330
U-Um...

41:04.330 --> 41:06.990
I know I'm a pain in the neck sometimes...

41:07.700 --> 41:09.780
but I hope you'll stick with me.

41:10.240 --> 41:10.990
Of course.

41:11.790 --> 41:14.200
Likewise, I hope you're okay with me.

41:16.560 --> 41:18.250
I'm counting on you.

41:18.250 --> 41:21.050
A handshake is fine, but I'd rather...

41:21.520 --> 41:22.910
I want... your hand.

41:23.510 --> 41:24.950
Your final objective...

41:24.950 --> 41:27.460
is to go somewhere together while holding hands!

41:32.050 --> 41:33.650
Y-Yeah.

41:34.250 --> 41:36.110
Mission accomplished, huh?

41:36.900 --> 41:38.040
Definitely.

41:43.670 --> 41:45.310
Are you okay, Inami-san?

41:45.310 --> 41:47.570
Let's get a drink at a convenience store.

41:47.570 --> 41:51.110
B-But, um, for a convenience store
to be the first place we go as a couple...

41:51.540 --> 41:52.840
That's okay.

41:52.840 --> 41:55.820
From now on, we'll have any number of
opportunities to hold hands.

41:56.330 --> 41:56.780
T—Takanashi-kun

41:57.060 --> 41:59.030
You knocked it out of the park, Takanashi-kun!

41:59.030 --> 41:59.740
Yamada-kun!?

42:00.860 --> 42:03.390
I spotted you two by coincidence,
so I secretly spied on...

42:03.390 --> 42:08.460
I mean watched over you, but I was so moved
that I accidentally revealed myself! Sorry!

42:09.050 --> 42:10.750
But congratulations, you two!

42:11.090 --> 42:12.330
Yamada-san...

42:12.330 --> 42:14.330
Takanashi-kun, no violence!

42:14.330 --> 42:15.970
Thank you.

42:16.590 --> 42:21.500
You're part of the reason Inami-san was able to get used to men.

42:21.500 --> 42:23.930
And as for me...

42:23.930 --> 42:27.440
You supported me in various ways,
so please accept my thanks.

42:27.900 --> 42:30.240
T-Takanashi-kun!

42:31.980 --> 42:33.600
But you're still the last person I wanted to see!

42:33.600 --> 42:34.530
Fair enough!

42:35.620 --> 42:36.490
And so...

42:37.020 --> 42:39.200
I apologize for making all of you worry about me.

42:40.470 --> 42:42.920
Inami and Taneshima, good job.

42:42.920 --> 42:45.700
Although Katanashi-kun's mother almost kidnapped me...

42:46.230 --> 42:48.830
My mom used to be little,

42:48.830 --> 42:50.880
yet she really loves little things.

42:50.880 --> 42:52.790
Where does your mother work?

42:52.790 --> 42:54.590
I'm going to ask her how to get bigger!

42:54.590 --> 42:55.420
I'm not telling you!

42:56.500 --> 42:59.230
Yachiyo-san, you don't have your katana.

42:59.230 --> 43:00.140
Oh, she's right!

43:00.140 --> 43:01.930
Th-That's right.

43:01.930 --> 43:04.660
I used to feel insecure without it...

43:04.660 --> 43:09.350
but Satou-kun said I don't need it
because he'll protect me!

43:09.700 --> 43:11.150
<i>Don't look at me like that.</i>

43:11.610 --> 43:13.860
<i>I want someone to say that to me!</i>

43:13.860 --> 43:15.320
<i>Don't look at me like that, either.</i>

43:15.320 --> 43:20.780
Well, Yachiyo's got a new job lined up,
so it looks like several things have been cleared up.

43:21.200 --> 43:22.740
Really, Yachiyo-san?

43:22.740 --> 43:26.290
Yes. At a family-run restaurant.

43:26.290 --> 43:28.380
The daughter is pregnant,

43:28.380 --> 43:31.250
so I'll work there until things settle down.

43:31.250 --> 43:33.750
So it's for a limited time, but it doesn't sound bad.

43:33.750 --> 43:37.210
But I'd rather see you become
Satou-kun's full-time housewi—

43:37.650 --> 43:39.840
That's good to hear, Yachiyo-san.

43:39.840 --> 43:41.980
Thank you, Mahiru-chan.

43:41.980 --> 43:43.180
But...

43:43.180 --> 43:47.100
I wonder how many more parfaits
I can make for Kyouko-san?

43:47.100 --> 43:48.430
Don't worry, Yachiyo.

43:48.430 --> 43:51.690
You'll just have to make a ton of them while you still can. Lots and lots.

43:52.140 --> 43:54.580
<i>Is she consoling her or is she just hungry?</i>

43:54.580 --> 43:55.900
<i>It's hard to tell.</i>

43:55.900 --> 43:59.570
Come to think of it,
the next Chief after Yachiyo-san—

43:59.570 --> 44:01.360
U-Um, actually...

44:01.740 --> 44:03.820
I'm the next Chief!

44:04.880 --> 44:09.640
It's nervewracking because I know I'm not as reliable as Yachiyo-san...

44:09.640 --> 44:14.190
but I'll do my best so you all
think I can handle it!

44:14.190 --> 44:16.300
W-Wait. I didn't mean it
like that, Taneshima-san.

44:16.940 --> 44:20.920
I thought you were going to be
the next Chief anyway.

44:20.920 --> 44:22.480
Yamada too.

44:22.480 --> 44:25.010
You just surprised Yamada
when you said "Actually..."

44:26.750 --> 44:27.920
Really?

44:27.920 --> 44:28.640
Yeah.

44:30.420 --> 44:32.020
Are you okay, Taneshima-san?

44:32.020 --> 44:33.390
I'm fine!

44:33.390 --> 44:35.750
I'm the new Chief!

44:35.750 --> 44:38.030
Count on me just like
you would a big sister.

44:38.030 --> 44:39.210
Taneshima...

44:39.850 --> 44:43.530
Satou-san, I'm sure you're going to call me something like Tiny Chief!

44:44.500 --> 44:46.070
You've grown bigger.

44:46.070 --> 44:47.490
In character, at least.

44:52.510 --> 44:53.550
There, there...

44:53.550 --> 44:55.110
Why are you clinging to Yachiyo?

44:55.110 --> 44:57.420
I'm not gonna cry on someone
who has a girlfriend!

44:57.420 --> 44:59.420
That's pretty mature.

44:59.940 --> 45:03.130
Senpai, let's keep doing our best!

45:05.460 --> 45:07.600
Yeah! Let's do our best!

45:09.470 --> 45:11.100
What are you all doing?

45:11.730 --> 45:14.850
A normal group of people came, an ordinary girl like me can't handle them alone!

45:15.970 --> 45:17.200
A group?

45:17.810 --> 45:19.440
It's me!

45:19.440 --> 45:21.690
I'm in love with someone

45:19.760 --> 45:21.150
Welcome!

45:21.690 --> 45:23.670
And that someone is you

45:22.130 --> 45:23.150
What's going on?

45:23.460 --> 45:24.610
Why are all of you here?

45:23.670 --> 45:25.760
Let's get closer

45:24.930 --> 45:28.090
Your mother said
she made trouble for you,

45:25.760 --> 45:27.820
Close enough to hug

45:27.820 --> 45:29.620
I love working

45:28.090 --> 45:29.620
and that I should make up for it by coming here.

45:29.620 --> 45:31.980
But I skip work out of love

45:30.150 --> 45:33.180
S-Sorry! Kozue dragged me here with her.

45:31.980 --> 45:33.970
So, I would like

45:33.180 --> 45:35.380
She got me to tag along, too.

45:33.970 --> 45:36.160
to stay here with you

45:35.380 --> 45:36.680
Oh, don't be like that.

45:36.160 --> 45:44.470
I can see our utopia far away

45:36.680 --> 45:39.380
Darling and Mikki, you guys are practically family!

45:39.790 --> 45:42.380
Everything is on me,
so order whatever you'd like.

45:42.380 --> 45:44.140
Yay! Beer!

45:44.140 --> 45:47.230
Izumi-san, you've come a long way.

45:44.470 --> 45:52.600
I will jump in the hot springs in your eyes

45:47.230 --> 45:50.730
We even managed to get her here without using the cart.

45:50.730 --> 45:52.600
I wanted to see you, Mahiru-chan.

45:52.600 --> 45:58.860
When someone rings the bell in your soul

45:53.560 --> 45:55.100
Thank you.

45:55.100 --> 46:00.150
Maybe I'll work here so you
and Sou-chan can take care of me.

45:58.860 --> 46:00.730
When the bell is rung

46:00.580 --> 46:02.110
<i>I have to be her caregiver already?</i>

46:00.730 --> 46:06.320
When you dream of him rubbing your hair

46:02.110 --> 46:04.860
You've been blessed
with a fine workplace, Souta-kun.

46:05.720 --> 46:07.900
Since you're all part-time workers,

46:07.900 --> 46:10.040
who knows how long you'll all be together,

46:08.030 --> 46:08.910
Go for it!

46:08.910 --> 46:15.290
When sadness suddenly hits you

46:10.040 --> 46:11.840
but I hope it's a long time.

46:11.840 --> 46:13.030
Yeah, me too.

46:13.030 --> 46:15.010
Like us, right?

46:15.010 --> 46:17.630
Hopefully they're not bound
to each other like a ball and chain.

46:15.290 --> 46:17.120
Right through the heart

46:17.120 --> 46:23.320
If you feel an ankle bone rubbing up against you

46:17.630 --> 46:21.550
I'm sure it must have been tough for you Nazuna, having to fill in for me here.

46:21.550 --> 46:22.890
Not at all.

46:22.890 --> 46:25.690
I learned a lot from working here.

46:23.320 --> 46:28.270
Then you are free to sweat

46:25.690 --> 46:30.470
I'm sure this experience will be very useful later on,
when I decide to take over the world.

46:32.260 --> 46:35.000
Oh come on, Onii-chan!
I'm obviously kidding!

46:35.000 --> 46:36.440
<i>It didn't sound like a joke.</i>

46:36.440 --> 46:37.440
What's this?

46:37.750 --> 46:40.490
Milady! Are things going well with Blondie?

46:40.490 --> 46:41.310
Yes.

46:41.770 --> 46:43.900
If anything happens, tell me right away!

46:42.060 --> 46:44.130
I love our future

46:43.900 --> 46:47.570
We'll always be on your side, Milady!

46:44.130 --> 46:46.110
And you are my morning

46:46.110 --> 46:48.250
So don't look at me

46:47.570 --> 46:50.310
I'm always ready to give you advice!

46:48.250 --> 46:50.290
so distantly

46:50.290 --> 46:52.280
That is why it's called a "crush"

46:50.310 --> 46:51.670
Mainly about bedroom matters...

46:51.670 --> 46:52.280
Knock it off!

46:52.280 --> 46:53.780
Inami-san!

46:52.280 --> 46:54.420
And also why I won't give up

46:53.780 --> 46:55.160
Don't bother the customers!

46:54.420 --> 46:56.490
I'll keep hanging on

46:55.680 --> 46:59.360
You brought Aoi-chan here, right?

46:56.490 --> 46:58.550
Till you think I'm cute

46:58.550 --> 47:06.790
I can see our rosy paradise in the skies of blue

46:59.360 --> 47:02.060
There have been some hard times,

47:02.060 --> 47:04.500
but she's gone back to her family.

47:05.090 --> 47:07.240
<i>I'm glad I brought her here.</i>

47:06.790 --> 47:14.930
Let's sit in our VIP seats behind the door!

47:07.240 --> 47:08.360
<i>She's gone?</i>

47:09.410 --> 47:13.030
Yamada was cleaning outside
and ran across Haruna-san.

47:13.030 --> 47:14.930
I really am glad I brought you here.

47:14.930 --> 47:21.440
If your heart is beating louder than a drum

47:15.680 --> 47:16.680
Souma-san!

47:16.680 --> 47:19.910
Yamada was useful to Otoo-san!

47:19.910 --> 47:21.930
I'm glad you had the chance
to repay his kindness.

47:21.440 --> 47:23.230
A loud drumbeat

47:21.930 --> 47:23.470
Since he's done so much for you.

47:23.230 --> 47:29.150
When you feel an ache right through your heart

47:23.470 --> 47:26.400
Yes. Yamada made Otoo-san happy.

47:26.760 --> 47:29.850
But Yamada isn't nearly satisfied yet.

47:29.850 --> 47:32.370
Yamada will make you happy too, Souma-san!

47:30.470 --> 47:31.480
Open up!

47:31.480 --> 47:37.930
When you are caught totally off guard

47:32.720 --> 47:34.580
Yeah, yeah. Thanks.

47:35.130 --> 47:38.790
You're going to have to become an adult before you can do that, though.

47:37.930 --> 47:39.530
Off your guard

47:38.790 --> 47:40.870
Yamada isn't an adult?

47:39.530 --> 47:45.250
When you puff your cheeks like a spoiled kid

47:40.870 --> 47:41.810
Nope.

47:44.360 --> 47:47.600
From now on, it'll be me cheering up Aoi-chan!

47:45.950 --> 47:48.970
Run and get what you want!

47:47.600 --> 47:48.970
Yeah, seems like it.

47:50.550 --> 47:53.470
I'm gonna do my best... as the Chief!

47:55.190 --> 47:58.890
Good luck, Senpai... as the Tiny Chief!

48:00.030 --> 48:01.110
Jeez!

48:01.110 --> 48:04.400
Katanashi-kun, I am <i>not</i> tiny!

48:20.840 --> 48:29.190
Our Garden of Eden lies beyond the window

48:29.190 --> 48:37.280
Let's break the glass and eat the forbidden fruit!

48:40.250 --> 48:46.910
The scales have slowly fallen from my eyes

48:46.910 --> 48:48.690
The scales have fallen off

48:48.690 --> 48:54.810
When the hairs on your knuckles expose your true feelings

48:55.890 --> 48:56.580
Go for it!

48:56.580 --> 49:03.420
When sadness suddenly hits you

49:03.420 --> 49:04.880
Right through the heart

49:04.880 --> 49:11.510
Walk around smoothly and gracefully

49:11.510 --> 49:15.940
And give him a wink

49:11.880 --> 49:13.720
Almost... There.

49:17.880 --> 49:20.280
Senpai, the customers are leaving.

49:20.280 --> 49:21.460
You're up!

49:21.460 --> 49:22.660
Okay!

49:29.570 --> 49:31.200
Thank you!

49:31.200 --> 49:33.650
Please come again!
